Archive: BLAKE3-1.8.7.tar.gz
Origname: BLAKE3-1.8.7
Name: blake3

    BLAKE3 1.8.7 with no Fil-C changes. The C sources are unchanged
    from 1.8.5, which was checked in unmodified, and 1.8.7 needs no
    Fil-C changes either. The archive is upstream with its three
    b3sum/LICENSE_* -> ../LICENSE_* symlinks repacked as regular-file
    copies, since projeny refuses archive symlinks whose targets
    contain "..".
